#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""nftwho — which rule in which chain of an nftables ruleset file decides
one fully specified packet at one traversal, and where that rule lives.

Static, pre-deploy adjudication over a ruleset file plus its include tree.
Never loads a ruleset, never invokes nft on user files, never reads the
live kernel ruleset. Semantics pinned in DESIGN-nftwho.md (NF00-NF31).
Stdlib only.
"""
